## Next action

The first fetch in Actions (fetch.yml with bootstrap, started by Ajay on 12 November) publishes the
first lake release and starts lake.yml, which builds the lake, publishes the serving release and
loads the API. Once the API answers ready: restore the lake release bronze here
(scripts/restore_release.py) and rebuild the lake, the backlog, the field and the manifest from it;
then scripts/verify_api.py, scripts/load_test.py with twenty idle minutes, web/scripts/live-check.mjs
awake and asleep, scripts/reset_and_rederive.py; then the cut-a-release skill.

